models downloaded from https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2
should be put here, and the configuration file edited appropriately

AI healing models (see `SMART --download-heal-model`) are also put here:
 - big-lama-dynamic-fp32.onnx (onnx backend; LaMa big-lama export by
   greycard, Apache-2.0, https://huggingface.co/jessolmstead/greycard-lama)
 - big-lama.pt (torch backend, e.g. for Metal/"mps"; LaMa big-lama,
   Apache-2.0, https://github.com/advimman/lama)
